give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Xenophobia\"", "italic": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Librarian", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Outsider. (Or that zero are in play.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Empath", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn how many of your 2 alive neighbors are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "High Priestess", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, learn which player the Storyteller believes you should talk to most."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Balloonist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn a player of a different character type than last night. [+0 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Dreamer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose a player (not yourself or Travellers): you learn 1 good & 1 evil character, 1 of which is correct."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Snake Charmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: a chosen Demon swaps characters & alignments with you & is then poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Monk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player (not yourself): they are safe from the Demon tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Gossip", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, you may make a public statement. Tonight, if it was true, a player dies."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Amnesiac", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know what your ability is. Each day, privately guess what it is: you learn how accurate you are."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Philosopher", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a good character: gain that ability. If this character is in play, they are drunk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Huntsman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a living player: the Damsel, if chosen, becomes a not-in-play Townsfolk. [+the Damsel]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Magician", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe Demon thinks you are a Minion. Minions think you are a Demon."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Virgin", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe 1st time you are nominated, if the nominator is a Townsfolk, they are executed immediately."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sweetheart", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die, 1 player is drunk from now on."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Plague Doctor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die, the Storyteller gains a Minion ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Recluse", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou might register as evil & as a Minion or Demon, even if dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mutant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you are \"mad\" about being an Outsider, you might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Damsel", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nAll Minions know a Damsel is in play. If a Minion publicly guesses you (once), your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Barber", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Demon may choose 2 players (not another Demon) to swap characters."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Godfather", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou start knowing which Outsiders are in play. If 1 died today, choose a player tonight: they die. [-1 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Baron", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nThere are extra Outsiders in play. [+2 Outsiders]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Marionette", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou think you are a good character, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are. [You neighbor the Demon]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Organ Grinder", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nAll players keep their eyes closed when voting and the vote tally is secret. Each night, choose if you are drunk until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fang Gu", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. The 1st Outsider this kills becomes an evil Fang Gu & you die instead. [+1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Thief", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach night, choose a player (not yourself): their vote counts negatively tomorrow."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bureaucrat", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach night, choose a player (not yourself): their vote counts as 3 votes tomorrow."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Judge", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnce per game, if another player nominated, you may choose to force the current execution to pass or fail."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Djinn", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nUse the Djinn's special rule. All players know what it is. (Speak with Storyteller)"]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Xenophobia Script", "italic": false, "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Xenophobia\"", "italic": false, "color": "dark_green"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]